OL,3,GNEWSANew fugitive team targets 'most
OL,4,Awanted' criminals
OL,5,
OL,6,FA new specialist team will track down
OL,7,Fthe most wanted criminals across two
OL,8,Fcounties.
OL,10,FHampshire police's new fugitive team
OL,11,Fwill target high-risk, high-harm
OL,12,Foffenders, including wanted suspects
OL,13,Fand prolific criminals.
OL,15,FInsp Tim Williams, who leads the team,
OL,16,Fsaid he wanted Hampshire and the Isle
OL,17,Fof Wight to be a "hostile environment
OL,18,Ffor those who cause us most harm".
OL,23,APub: 11-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
